WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.960
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:11.230 --> 00:14.460
[Ryu Seil]

3
00:18.880 --> 00:22.340
[Ha Junghoon]

4
00:26.410 --> 00:29.660
[Lee Jungchan]

5
00:33.480 --> 00:36.980
[Jeong Siwan]

6
00:42.340 --> 00:47.020
[Boy, with Caution]

7
00:53.900 --> 00:55.930
Okay, that's about all I want to ask.

8
00:57.950 --> 01:00.030
You said you can start working tomorrow, right?

9
01:00.030 --> 01:00.980
Yes.

10
01:04.319 --> 01:06.390
[Experience: Seojin High School, contract teacher; Nakwon High School, contract teacher; Saebit High School, contract teacher; Cheongga High School, contract teacher]

11
01:04.340 --> 01:06.750
You should have other schools to choose from.

12
01:06.750 --> 01:09.300
Why did you come back to us?

13
01:17.190 --> 01:18.240
Here's the final question:

14
01:18.240 --> 01:23.510
in your opinion, would you think you're what you'd think is a good teacher?

15
01:31.910 --> 01:34.229
I used to think so.

16
02:10.750 --> 02:12.390
This is the staff restroom.

17
02:13.770 --> 02:15.030
Are you a teacher?

18
02:17.820 --> 02:19.050
Not yet.

19
02:20.820 --> 02:22.280
You're a senior, right?

20
02:27.690 --> 02:30.150
Did you mistake this for the nurse's office?

21
02:30.690 --> 02:31.800
I didn't.

22
02:33.710 --> 02:34.870
I know.

23
02:36.470 --> 02:38.730
But you'd better go and get that checked.

24
02:41.920 --> 02:42.940
See you around.

25
03:10.820 --> 03:13.860
[Lee Hyunjae]

26
03:13.860 --> 03:26.790
[Boy, with Caution] [Episode 1]

27
03:47.020 --> 03:49.510
[Mom]

28
03:56.750 --> 04:01.140
[When you want to be honest, come to Random Chat and chat freely!]

29
04:10.160 --> 04:11.240
Son, you're back.

30
04:24.780 --> 04:27.530
What are you so busy with? I can't even reach you.

31
04:27.810 --> 04:30.740
-Why didn't you answer the phone? -Jiyoung and I ate first after waiting for you.

32
04:30.740 --> 04:33.130
-When did you arrive? -30 minutes ago.

33
04:45.740 --> 04:46.540
Did you drink?

34
04:46.610 --> 04:48.610
Yes, I drank a little because of you.

35
04:52.500 --> 04:56.500
No matter what, you have to remember to celebrate your wife's birthday.

36
04:56.760 --> 05:01.480
Oh, seeing you in a suit, I thought you'd bring flowers back.

37
05:01.760 --> 05:02.960
I had an interview.

38
05:04.770 --> 05:05.670
I forgot.

39
05:05.870 --> 05:06.780
Sorry.

40
05:07.970 --> 05:09.080
What interview?

41
05:09.810 --> 05:11.470
Another contract job, right?

42
05:12.680 --> 05:16.280
How long do you plan to do contract jobs?

43
05:16.280 --> 05:18.480
It makes it seem like you have some flaw.

44
05:19.680 --> 05:21.480
Son, she just didn't say it out loud.

45
05:21.480 --> 05:23.800
Jiyoung must be so worried about you.

46
05:24.710 --> 05:26.060
My income is not bad anyway.

47
05:26.060 --> 05:27.080
It's fine.

48
05:27.900 --> 05:30.510
Mom, well...

49
05:32.550 --> 05:34.200
If I don't answer the phone in the future, don't come.

50
05:34.200 --> 05:35.630
-We... -Mom.

51
05:36.610 --> 05:38.240
Serve me some more soup.

52
05:38.480 --> 05:39.340
Okay.

53
05:59.460 --> 06:02.050
[Random Chat]

54
06:05.780 --> 06:06.740
Go back.

55
06:19.600 --> 06:22.320
If my mom asks you to drink in the future, just decline.

56
06:22.320 --> 06:24.030
Don't you dislike the smell?

57
06:26.150 --> 06:27.680
You came to get this, right?

58
06:28.270 --> 06:30.230
What future do we have?

59
06:36.180 --> 06:38.690
"When you want to be honest"

60
06:38.950 --> 06:41.430
and "When you want to confide in someone"—

61
06:41.580 --> 06:43.180
which of these two is better?

62
06:44.480 --> 06:46.060
"When you want to be honest."

63
06:46.060 --> 06:47.230
Right?

64
06:49.110 --> 06:51.110
The advertisers just have no taste.

65
06:51.280 --> 06:53.290
I've told them so many times that this one is better.

66
06:53.290 --> 06:54.270
Did you call a designated driver?

67
06:54.270 --> 06:55.110
Yeah.

68
06:55.630 --> 06:56.710
I just did.

69
06:57.220 --> 06:59.630
How long do you plan to hide it from your mom?

70
07:00.590 --> 07:02.580
Since you're being so obvious about it,

71
07:02.580 --> 07:04.440
you might as well tell her sooner.

72
07:04.440 --> 07:06.050
Don't do it when I'm around.

73
07:07.620 --> 07:09.730
Didn't you take off your ring?

74
07:15.140 --> 07:16.410
Are you a teacher?

75
07:16.530 --> 07:17.710
Not yet.

76
07:18.880 --> 07:20.550
[Lee Hyunjae]

77
07:19.060 --> 07:20.390
You're a senior, right?

78
07:25.700 --> 07:27.370
I probably left it when I went for the interview.

79
07:27.370 --> 07:28.970
Did you decide to work there?

80
07:29.550 --> 07:30.550
When do you start?

81
07:30.600 --> 07:31.460
Tomorrow.

82
07:32.290 --> 07:33.430
Which school?

83
07:34.900 --> 07:36.350
Nakwon High School.

84
07:42.130 --> 07:46.409
Did they ask you... to go there?

85
07:52.950 --> 07:55.210
My driver probably can't find their way.

86
07:55.390 --> 07:56.250
I'm leaving.

87
07:56.400 --> 07:57.200
Jiyoung.

88
08:04.300 --> 08:06.230
Stay the night and leave tomorrow.

89
08:09.630 --> 08:12.090
Wouldn't you be uncomfortable with me here?

90
08:12.120 --> 08:13.420
Just have a good sleep.

91
08:13.970 --> 08:14.990
Go back.

92
08:16.600 --> 08:17.800
Hello, driver.

93
08:19.050 --> 08:21.650
I'm at the entrance of Building 303.

94
08:21.920 --> 08:23.160
I'll come to you.

95
08:29.730 --> 08:34.690
[Create a nickname]

96
08:44.320 --> 08:49.870
[Regret]

97
08:49.990 --> 08:53.200
[Nickname created] [Nice to meet you! Regret, would you like to start a new chat?]

98
08:53.550 --> 08:54.300
[Yes]

99
09:05.420 --> 09:08.660
[Sunflower: Why is your nickname Regret?]

100
09:06.760 --> 09:08.640
Why is your nickname Regret?

101
09:14.510 --> 09:15.670
Well...

102
09:18.230 --> 09:20.780
I couldn't think of any other words.

103
09:22.730 --> 09:25.100
The first semester of senior year is almost over

104
09:25.100 --> 09:26.450
but we have a new contract staff.

105
09:26.450 --> 09:28.720
How long will he take to get the hang of it?

106
09:28.840 --> 09:30.540
And he's a fixed-term contract teacher.

107
09:30.540 --> 09:32.970
By the way, is Ms. Kim Haesook very sick?

108
09:33.170 --> 09:34.770
She's a senior homeroom teacher.

109
09:34.770 --> 09:36.280
I don't know either.

110
09:43.240 --> 09:45.270
I don't know how this sounds.

111
09:45.620 --> 09:50.200
This is Mr. Jang Kiwoo, who is substituting for Ms. Kim Haesook.

112
09:55.010 --> 09:56.720
Nice to meet you.

113
10:05.500 --> 10:06.860
I feel regret for my situation.

114
10:06.850 --> 10:09.600
[Jang Kiwoo]

115
10:14.280 --> 10:17.080
Please take good care of me for the remaining time.

116
10:18.250 --> 10:19.850
I'm going to start roll call.

117
10:20.640 --> 10:21.370
Shin Jaehak.

118
10:21.390 --> 10:22.130
Here.

119
10:22.550 --> 10:23.150
Lee Jiyun.

120
10:23.260 --> 10:23.910
Here.

121
10:24.100 --> 10:25.020
Lee Hyunjae.

122
10:29.430 --> 10:30.520
Lee Hyunjae?

123
10:37.610 --> 10:39.540
Can anyone contact Hyunjae?

124
10:44.380 --> 10:45.180
Next.

125
10:45.370 --> 10:46.030
Joo Youngji.

126
10:46.030 --> 10:46.710
Here.

127
10:53.780 --> 10:55.440
If you call with your cell phone, they might answer—

128
10:55.440 --> 10:57.640
though I don't know who you're calling.

129
10:59.890 --> 11:02.350
No one answers a landline number these days.

130
11:02.440 --> 11:05.120
Communication has all been moved over to KakaoTalk.

131
11:05.120 --> 11:07.900
Ah, that's the college application form.

132
11:08.030 --> 11:10.290
A student in our class took the seniors' by mistake.

133
11:10.290 --> 11:11.660
Ah, okay.

134
11:18.770 --> 11:20.330
[Nakwon High School College Application Form]

135
11:20.630 --> 11:28.910
[Nakwon High School College Application Form] [Lee Hyunjae]

136
11:31.770 --> 11:32.700
Mr. Choi.

137
11:33.850 --> 11:35.980
If the parents' contact information section is blank,

138
11:35.980 --> 11:37.440
How should I handle it?

139
11:37.570 --> 11:38.990
It's my first time seeing this.

140
11:38.990 --> 11:40.390
It's Lee Hyunjae, right?

141
11:43.200 --> 11:45.340
You were calling Hyunjae just now?

142
11:45.780 --> 11:48.150
We don't need to worry about his college application.

143
11:48.150 --> 11:49.550
He'll probably go study abroad.

144
11:49.550 --> 11:51.150
His background is so strong.

145
11:51.820 --> 11:52.800
Background?

146
11:53.020 --> 11:54.040
Yeah.

147
11:54.200 --> 11:55.570
The chairman's son.

148
11:57.850 --> 12:00.910
You seem to be past the years of caring for students.

149
12:01.490 --> 12:02.730
It's not like that.

150
12:03.340 --> 12:06.600
Then are you trying to score some points with the chairman?

151
12:08.610 --> 12:09.960
Even if he leaves early without saying a word,

152
12:09.960 --> 12:12.330
just treat it as he came to school.

153
12:12.610 --> 12:14.480
Maybe his family background is too strong.

154
12:14.480 --> 12:17.010
They don't allow any flaws on their child.

155
12:23.370 --> 12:25.170
Time is passing so slowly today.

156
12:25.190 --> 12:26.340
We should go eat lunch, right?

157
12:26.340 --> 12:27.580
Okay, let's go.

158
12:28.470 --> 12:32.330
Ah. Do you want to eat lunch with us?

159
12:34.230 --> 12:35.780
I'm good.

160
12:36.810 --> 12:38.580
I have plans.

161
12:38.910 --> 12:39.900
You're busy.

162
12:40.150 --> 12:40.960
Let's go.

163
12:41.100 --> 12:41.840
Let's go.

164
12:50.960 --> 12:52.710
How regretful indeed—

165
12:52.580 --> 12:55.370
[How regretful indeed— that no one is having lunch with you.]

166
12:53.320 --> 12:55.450
that no one is having lunch with you.

167
13:50.000 --> 13:53.710
[Lee Hyunjae]

168
13:56.020 --> 13:58.080
I always run into you in weird places.

169
13:59.790 --> 14:01.140
Are you a teacher now?

170
14:01.490 --> 14:02.360
Yeah,

171
14:03.630 --> 14:04.960
your homeroom teacher.

172
14:12.650 --> 14:15.640
You didn't go to the nurse's office last time, did you?

173
14:15.640 --> 14:16.640
I did.

174
14:19.590 --> 14:22.300
Actually, I didn't need to go to the nurse's office.

175
14:22.300 --> 14:23.560
It's boring, isn't it?

176
14:23.900 --> 14:25.530
Going to school at your age.

177
14:26.140 --> 14:28.140
You skip classes whenever you want.

178
14:28.430 --> 14:29.600
It's not like that.

179
14:30.220 --> 14:31.290
Then what is it?

180
14:33.170 --> 14:35.010
You don't have to worry about me.

181
14:36.450 --> 14:37.520
Why?

182
14:38.600 --> 14:40.600
Because you're the chairman's son?

183
14:45.610 --> 14:46.550
Yes.

184
14:48.590 --> 14:51.790
I'll take care of myself. You don't have to worry about me.

185
14:51.880 --> 14:53.040
Then...

186
14:54.860 --> 14:56.780
don't make me worry.

187
14:58.010 --> 14:59.780
I mean, take care of yourself,

188
15:00.010 --> 15:01.450
just like you said.

189
15:53.300 --> 15:54.190
Bro.

190
15:57.040 --> 15:58.160
It's your turn

191
15:58.920 --> 16:00.450
to take graduation photos.

192
16:02.280 --> 16:03.750
I'm not going to take one.

193
16:04.180 --> 16:05.280
It's compulsory.

194
16:10.570 --> 16:12.570
You didn't see anyone else, did you?

195
16:12.910 --> 16:14.140
Like Kim Jungha.

196
16:16.800 --> 16:17.840
Who's that?

197
16:18.010 --> 16:19.700
[Kim Jungha]

198
16:25.840 --> 16:27.400
Did Youngmoon send you?

199
16:28.170 --> 16:30.240
Where did he buy that drug?

200
16:30.520 --> 16:32.080
Can you tell me?

201
16:32.990 --> 16:34.520
How would I know?

202
16:35.090 --> 16:36.050
Just once.

203
16:38.490 --> 16:40.130
Just tell me the name.

204
16:40.840 --> 16:42.700
I'll buy it myself.

205
16:54.940 --> 16:57.110
Wow, look at that fucking restrained look.

206
16:57.110 --> 16:59.260
No wonder they call him an obedient vending machine.

207
16:59.260 --> 17:00.570
He passes the test.

208
17:00.640 --> 17:01.290
Passed.

209
17:01.430 --> 17:02.600
What passed? Jeez.

210
17:02.730 --> 17:04.880
You couldn't even speak a word in front of Kim Jungha.

211
17:04.880 --> 17:07.480
That's why I'm talking behind his back, idiot.

212
17:10.260 --> 17:12.579
After the test, the actual game officially begins.

213
17:12.579 --> 17:14.369
I'm really going to tell Lee Hyunjae

214
17:14.369 --> 17:15.369
to help buy the drug.

215
17:15.369 --> 17:18.349
Hey, he seems to be done.

216
17:25.760 --> 17:26.660
Bro.

217
17:26.990 --> 17:29.890
Let's talk.

218
17:37.100 --> 17:39.300
Fentanyl, cocaine, and stuff like that

219
17:39.330 --> 17:41.330
are too boring. No one will buy them.

220
17:41.420 --> 17:43.020
As long as you can get them,

221
17:43.410 --> 17:45.200
we'll find a way to sell them.

222
17:45.310 --> 17:46.440
As usual.

223
17:47.380 --> 17:49.440
There's that top-tier stuff, right?

224
17:49.590 --> 17:51.980
You seem to know a pharmacist.

225
17:52.110 --> 17:54.240
Just get a prescription, grind it into powder, and bring it here.

226
17:54.240 --> 17:55.550
You know the drill.

227
17:55.880 --> 17:57.070
Why should I?

228
17:59.710 --> 18:00.860
Come on,

229
18:01.030 --> 18:03.280
we're discussing this nicely with you.

230
18:05.610 --> 18:07.740
I'm speaking nicely too.

231
18:11.120 --> 18:12.460
Why should I do this?

232
18:12.700 --> 18:15.900
Even if we get caught, we'll just be sent to juvenile hall.

233
18:16.230 --> 18:17.760
You'll have to go to prison.

234
18:20.270 --> 18:21.470
Are you threatening me?

235
18:21.470 --> 18:24.360
Oh, if you think this is a threat, I can't help it.

236
18:27.880 --> 18:31.580
If you want to threaten someone, go find the bastard who threatened you.

237
18:31.580 --> 18:32.770
Go ahead.

238
18:33.490 --> 18:36.090
I don't care if you report it or call the police.

239
18:45.090 --> 18:48.550
If we take this kid down, we can definitely catch a pharmacist.

240
18:52.880 --> 18:54.130
Hey, it's me.

241
18:55.360 --> 18:57.830
I've given you a lot of money before.

242
18:57.950 --> 18:59.300
Just do me a favor.

243
19:10.380 --> 19:11.320
Hey.

244
19:14.650 --> 19:15.710
What are you doing?

245
19:16.200 --> 19:17.180
Part-time job.

246
19:17.300 --> 19:18.290
Part-time job?

247
19:19.690 --> 19:22.140
Hey, I don't have training today.

248
19:22.800 --> 19:24.100
Can I go to your place?

249
19:26.760 --> 19:28.420
Don't say things like that at school.

250
19:28.420 --> 19:29.420
What kind of part-time job are you doing?

251
19:29.420 --> 19:30.540
A darn good one.

252
19:31.330 --> 19:32.190
Hey.

253
19:33.070 --> 19:35.410
I see you're hanging out with Choi Youngmin. Are you stealing things now?

254
19:35.410 --> 19:36.730
It's not like that.

255
19:37.810 --> 19:39.540
Just pretend you don't know.

256
19:39.740 --> 19:42.000
I already know. How can I pretend I don't?

257
19:43.140 --> 19:45.070
Just like how you usually treat me.

258
19:52.660 --> 19:53.720
Someone's coming.

259
19:59.070 --> 20:00.100
See?

260
20:01.780 --> 20:03.140
You're good at it.

261
20:04.350 --> 20:06.750
Pretending not to know when you clearly do.

262
20:13.600 --> 20:15.060
I'll go over when I'm done.

263
20:26.190 --> 20:27.400
Hey, call my phone.

264
20:27.590 --> 20:28.420
Okay.

265
20:34.000 --> 20:36.260
I think I hear something from somewhere.

266
20:45.200 --> 20:47.300
Bro, can I take a look?

267
20:48.240 --> 20:50.270
I lost my phone.

268
20:50.440 --> 20:52.500
I heard a vibration coming from here.

269
20:54.900 --> 20:57.140
I heard you opened the sports equipment room for him.

270
20:57.140 --> 20:59.160
Are you talking about Hyunjae?

271
21:01.300 --> 21:03.120
Yes, him.

272
21:04.110 --> 21:08.270
I mean, I'm keeping an eye on Hyunjae,

273
21:08.410 --> 21:10.240
so you don't need to worry.

274
21:11.910 --> 21:15.310
So... you knew he was locked in the equipment room?

275
21:17.260 --> 21:18.920
He wasn't locked in.

276
21:19.960 --> 21:23.270
He just needed some time.

277
21:23.590 --> 21:27.770
You know those "thinking chairs" that help people calm down and think?

278
21:28.990 --> 21:31.230
Just think of it as him sitting on a thinking chair for a while.

279
21:31.230 --> 21:32.960
Does that make you feel better?

280
21:35.780 --> 21:38.070
Mr. Jang, you might want to go take a look.

281
21:39.480 --> 21:42.270
I told you there's a vibration coming from your bag.

282
21:42.270 --> 21:43.960
I just want to take a look.

283
21:44.100 --> 21:45.960
Are you trying to hide something?

284
21:47.070 --> 21:48.120
This is so weird.

285
21:48.250 --> 21:51.110
Everyone else let me see theirs. Why won't you?

286
21:51.350 --> 21:53.520
Do you want me to open my bag for you?

287
21:53.680 --> 21:55.210
You guys open your bags too.

288
22:07.420 --> 22:08.540
It's your turn.

289
22:24.790 --> 22:26.910
It is you.

290
22:49.870 --> 22:52.710
Is this what you meant by not making me worry

291
22:52.860 --> 22:54.460
and taking care of yourself?

292
22:59.950 --> 23:02.260
As long as you don't interfere, sir.

293
23:07.850 --> 23:09.060
Let's start class.

294
23:10.920 --> 23:14.180
Class starts in 5 minutes. Everyone, go back to your seats.

295
23:28.260 --> 23:33.640
[Boy, with Caution]

296
23:34.080 --> 23:35.450
What? Stealing a phone?

297
23:35.700 --> 23:37.550
Didn't I tell you to behave no matter what it takes you?

298
23:37.550 --> 23:38.410
Is it that hard?

299
23:38.410 --> 23:41.210
It's better to make him reconcile with Youngmoon.

300
23:41.220 --> 23:42.250
Don't worry about anything.

301
23:42.250 --> 23:43.220
Lee Hyunjae.

302
23:43.360 --> 23:46.520
Just make sure his face is a bloody mess.

303
23:46.730 --> 23:48.230
I stole that phone.

304
23:48.550 --> 23:50.410
I just need to pay him back, right?

305
23:50.480 --> 23:52.370
Is this what the chairman asked for?

306
23:52.370 --> 23:54.610
Have you always been like this?

307
23:54.920 --> 23:58.200
I'm just curious if you treat all students like this.

308
23:58.460 --> 24:00.230
Consider it special treatment.

309
24:00.230 --> 24:02.100
Yes, things like this happen.

310
24:02.380 --> 24:04.180
Sometimes I want to run away too.

311
24:04.220 --> 24:05.890
-It's getting late today— -Mr. Jang.
